<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Peer-to-peer video calls with rich 1:1 layouts, self-view control, screen sharing, PiP, reactions and live quality indicators."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_camera}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Starting a Video Call")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_p2p", "In the P2P session, click")} <strong>{dgettext("lobby", "Start video")}</strong>{dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    ". P2P media is self-controlled: either peer can start camera or microphone independently, and the other side joins the media surface automatically."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_display}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Layout")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Two layouts: Focus puts your peer's picture in front with yours in a corner, and Split puts the two of you side by side. Click the remote tile to switch between them. The self-view button moves your own video between tile, picture-in-picture and hidden; side by side, it shows or hides it."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "With the P2P Session Console focused, Ctrl+Shift+ArrowRight switches layout and Ctrl+Shift+ArrowDown cycles self-view."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_call_phone_end}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Leaving the Call")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Leave ends the call for you only. Your peer stays in it and is told you left; start audio or video again to rejoin. End P2P session closes everything for both of you."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_screen_share}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Screen Share")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Click Share Screen to replace your camera feed with a browser display-capture track. Stopping from the browser or from the button restores the previous camera when possible; the peer sees a screen badge."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Ctrl+Shift+. toggles screen sharing when the P2P Session Console is focused. A shared screen automatically favors the focus layout."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_heart}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Reactions")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "Reaction buttons send short visual effects over the active P2P session. They appear on the call tiles and do not create private-message rows."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_camera_off}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Turn Camera Off/On")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_p2p", "Click")}
  <strong>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Turn Camera Off")}</strong> {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "to pause the video. The peer will see a placeholder."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_pip}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Picture-in-Picture")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_p2p", "Click")} <strong>{dgettext("help_p2p", "PiP")}</strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "to pop the remote video into a floating window that stays visible while navigating other tabs."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-universal-lobby">{dgettext("help_p2p", "P2P Session")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-audio-call">{dgettext("help_p2p", "Audio Call")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-media-devices">{dgettext("help_p2p", "Media Devices")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-call-quality">{dgettext("help_p2p", "Call Quality")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-privacy-settings">
    {dgettext("help_p2p", "Privacy Settings")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
